WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,590
I am naturally different from her

2
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:19,350
Go in first

3
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:21,950
This must be Aunt Lou

4
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:23,450
Looks harmless

5
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:26,850
But she can make her second uncle argue in public over her clothes and suitability.

6
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:30,050
As expected, there is no simple woman in this house.

7
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:36,080
I heard what happened yesterday

8
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:37,940
My sister has been wronged

9
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:40,140
My mother-in-law is good at everything

10
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:41,940
The ears are soft and easy to be provoked

11
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,740
This sister-in-law is a smart person

12
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:44,740
Didn't get involved yesterday

13
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,740
Today I'm here again to try to clear up the relationship.

14
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,340
My sister-in-law is feeling better

15
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:49,940
I heard you were feeling unwell yesterday

16
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,830
I didn’t go over to see you either

17
00:00:51,830 --> 00:00:53,230
It doesn't matter

18
00:00:53,230 --> 00:00:54,430
I was just a little bit happy
